% D-0258, e2e stream seed 3103 model 124, shrunk: SAT; under --e2e (E2E_SOLVER=1, tools/e2e/chain.sh) veripb refuses baguette's own proof against cake's .opb (a SYNTAX error in the .pbp); array_int_maximum over a constant and a signed variable (x2 in -1..1; 0..1 verifies). Plain --proof and the bridged path VERIFY. Opt-in flag, solver defect (lib/proof/e2e.ml prefix).
var 1..2: x0 :: output_var;
var -1..1: x2 :: output_var;
array [1..2] of var int: A :: var_is_introduced = [x2,1];
constraint array_int_maximum(x0,A);
solve satisfy;
